3, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1148365,\"title\":\"Matchbox the Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHhHRz6nOpwkqJs5ASeRGAdK2dt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdJsnhHfkIi3J7jwfiCFT4gXNx5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a group of former childhood friends reconnect, their reunion takes a wild turn as they stumble upon a dangerous international plot—and must save the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1377237,\"title\":\"Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJk2TW1QZAmBiD7oj9ZF9EPTYY1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npXZNWjOEYrqdMDPQ11SGBrXqAG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former soldier is thrown into a brutal race against time when a critical medical delivery makes him and his unlikely partner the targets of a ruthless cartel. As the mission spirals into a deadly manhunt, every detour, delay, and bullet pushes them closer to failure. With betrayal closing in from every side, they must survive the chase and deliver their cargo to save the life of a little girl.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":533535,\"title\":\"Deadpool & Wolverine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/by8z9Fe8y7p4jo2YlW2SZDnptyT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14034,\"title\":\"What's the Worst That Could Happen?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dF9vz1LB6078ULfweT2vxdWZzos.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tONZXxOfDjYYSeVaGSmLpHpqO5B.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thief Kevin Caffery attempts to rob from the home of rich businessman Max Fairbanks. But Fairbanks catches him and steals his cherished ring that his girlfriend gave him. Caffery is then bent on revenge and getting his ring back with the help of his partners.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":293660,\"title\":\"Deadpool\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3E53WEZJqP6aM84D8CckXx4pIHw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rFj9IKlL75B2pXhZA60jkNWvxeW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who, after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1168190,\"title\":\"The Wrecking Crew\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gbVwHl4YPSq6BcC92TQpe7qUTh6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cz4vLJrmaV1zJlRYbxqtvLzeLWB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Estranged half-brothers Jonny and James reunite after their father's mysterious death. As they search for the truth, buried secrets reveal a conspiracy threatening to tear their family apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":177572,\"title\":\"Big Hero 6\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2mxS4wUimwlLmI1xp6QW6NSU361.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4s2d3xdyqotiVNHTlTlJjrr3q0H.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A special bond develops between plus-sized inflatable robot Baymax, and prodigy Hiro Hamada, who team up with a group of friends to form a band of high-tech heroes.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":939243,\"title\":\"Sonic the Hedgehog 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d8Ryb8AunYAuycVKDp5HpdWPKgC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zOpe0eHsq0A2NvNyBbtT6sj53qV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sonic, Knuckles, and Tails reunite against a powerful new adversary, Shadow, a mysterious villain with powers unlike anything they have faced before. With their abilities outmatched in every way, Team Sonic must seek out an unlikely alliance in hopes of stopping Shadow and protecting the planet.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":519182,\"title\":\"Despicable Me 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wWba3TaojhK7NdycRhoQpsG0FaH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/twsxsfao6ZOVvT8LfudH603MMi6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gru and Lucy and their girls—Margo, Edith and Agnes—welcome a new member to the Gru family, Gru Jr., who is intent on tormenting his dad. Gru also faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his femme fatale girlfriend Valentina, forcing the family to go on the run.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":284053,\"title\":\"Thor: Ragnarok\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vLmHH8jAy8Jq8uBsLucd3592WGh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"hr1BS_Jk7uI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nMB1DnnJTZU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"WXyYgzeIab8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}